Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.36,0:00:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：隐没于云上在天空的遗迹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.精灵 神龙与凯特的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 以彼此的龙为赌注
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 神龙接连使出的名为试炼的壁垒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接连不断地挡在凯特面前＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.65,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)糟了 凯特那家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)吸取龙现在的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是 8000。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼要是受到攻击的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)而且 吸取龙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会给予对手那个时点攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.85,0:00:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一半 也就是4000的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)这样下去的话 凯特那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本束手无策。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神龙)来吧 怎么办 凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)要动手的话 就快点动手。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神龙)放心好了。吸取龙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的回合 无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)那 快斗他…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.22,0:00:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真龙)我这就 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你捡回一条命了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.65,0:01:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)你这家伙 打算愚弄我吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真龙)别误会。 这是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赐予你的试炼。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是阻挡在你面前的壁障。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想看看 你究竟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要如何跨越它。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但若是无法跨越{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这壁障便会将你吞噬吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)少开玩笑了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)总算是 得救了 但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗若无法在这个回合打破这个局面{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他就会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真龙)来吧 怎么了 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「德斯特帕雷特·斯库雷普」。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.43,0:01:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡支付800生命值，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手怪兽的原本攻击力减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:01:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「汲魂龙」的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本攻击力是4000。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.34,0:02:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此下降2000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，「汲魂龙」{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会将我的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加算到攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.80,0:02:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于我的生命值减少了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它的攻击力也会下降。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)没想到快斗竟然削减自己的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来降低那家伙怪兽的攻击力……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)哦？不过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「汲魂龙」的攻击力是5200。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是没能越过这堵墙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)而且我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 龙之灵庙·神域！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有 等级8以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙族怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付1000生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这回合 将使用过的墓地中最上方的魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.55,0:02:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回收 死亡导游·抄写。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 由于我的生命值减少了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.21,0:02:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸取龙 的攻击力会进一步下降。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 快斗又支付生命值了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:02:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光) 真不愧是。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能瞬间想到这种程度的对策。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 你在说什么啊。那家伙的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经只剩2200了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 不 那家伙的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该只会剩下200吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗) 然后 我再次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 分离·撕裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付800生命值… 呃…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手怪兽的原本攻击力减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸取龙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的原本攻击力是 2000。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 我的生命值减少之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降 800。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)银河眼攻击力超过了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)上吧！ 银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击 吸取龙!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(仁伦)我的生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)干得漂亮 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(仁伦)在这个瞬间 吸取龙的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个时点的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一半的伤害给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的生命值只剩200了……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)啊啊，我早就知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)要打倒攻击力8000的龙·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕只能靠这个方法了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)搞什么啊……就我一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像等级不一样似的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)不必在意。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我早就心知肚明。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)少罗嗦！我也是有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白的事情的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.55,0:04:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)那就是快斗会赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:05:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)但是留给他的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅仅只有200。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果不其然…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)我的场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 除了龙宫之外
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其他怪兽都消失了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙再次现身。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)陷阱卡发动！杀戮奖励！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在破坏对方怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那只怪兽是等级7以上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能抽2张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的龙宫龙是等级8。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我抽2张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放2张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)龙宫龙的试炼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你已经跨越了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是最后的壁垒可不止这种程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动龙宫的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽没有超量素材时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有这张卡以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当自己场上没有龙族怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将对方场上的1只龙族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.67,0:07:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的灵魂银河眼，我就收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过……这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你支付一半生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再破坏银河眼的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)我们巴利安的力量竟然无法使用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座山到底是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？这种感觉是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)怎么会……快斗竟然
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己要破坏银河眼……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)银河眼的力量，你应该
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是最清楚的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用自己的手去破坏也是一个选择。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与其落到敌人手里不如用自己的手破坏掉？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)你这家伙是不会明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和银河眼之间的羁绊有多深。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有我就没有银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有银河眼也就没有我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更何况 凭你一句话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就要我把银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏掉 绝不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)唔… 既然如此 那那只银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由我收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 龙·鲁恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)银河眼变成海马的敌人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)这算是最后的仁慈。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用你自己的怪兽来埋葬你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧！ 银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对海马 直接攻击！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)海马…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)海马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)发动永续陷阱！ 命运破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是 当对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击过来的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 那张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是怪兽卡的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那次战斗无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 抽到的是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽卡 银河骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆) 把决斗交给运气了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)不是运气！ 是必然！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆)你说什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)最强的决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连抽卡都能自己引导！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我和银河眼的羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆)但是 我还有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙皇的攻击残留着。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 龙皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.69,0:10:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次对海马 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火炎神激！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)我 再一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动命运破坏的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)呜哦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我从卡组抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的是另一张银河骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 龙锁龙的效果无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.51,0:10:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)然后 命运破击的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束时 这张卡被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将因这张卡的效果抽到的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效并特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将两只银河骑士特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.60,0:10:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)唔！ 我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)总… 总算是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.67,0:10:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗挡下了金隆的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:10:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)但是 这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.21,0:11:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗也无计可施。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运·超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择对方场上的怪兽与{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)用对方的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来进行超量召唤!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)我将2只等级8的银河骑士与{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你场上的银河眼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻涌的银河啊此刻化作怒涛之光{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显现出你的身姿吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 我的灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.05,0:12:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)到底山顶上到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高贵之龙的咆哮。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在战斗，两条龙在…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)新银河眼光子龙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺回了自己的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还进一步让它进化了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)这样一来，只要新银河眼的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)不。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)忘了吗，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.73,0:12:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要龙锁龙在场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方场上龙族怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果将会无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)新银河眼的效果被封锁了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)而且，龙锁龙是 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡只能被 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:13:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)再加上龙锁龙的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一回合，新银河眼时空龙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会成为我的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)怎么会！那这样的话，快斗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就必须在这个回合分出胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)别吵！安静看着。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)可是，再这样下去的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我的胜利早已注定。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我发动墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量狙击手的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡除外，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个超量素材的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降500点对方怪兽的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.74,0:13:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材有3个。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，下降1500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，我再从墓地里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·增幅的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的1只怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 新银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升1500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)太厉害了 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)上吧！ 新银河眼光子龙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏龙兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)别小看我。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 龙之舞蹈。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的龙族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.11,0:14:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中的2只龙族除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力的合计数值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.47,0:14:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从新银河眼的攻击力中下降。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要除外的是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护龙和 吸取龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只龙族的攻击力合计是6000。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 新银河眼时空龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 下降6000！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)新银河眼时空龙的攻击力变成 零了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)这下不妙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场战斗 已经无法阻止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.69,0:14:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 反击回去 龙装枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永别了 海斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.91,0:15:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)该消失的 是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)反击陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河龙鳞 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.39,0:15:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在龙族怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手发动的 陷阱卡的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动与效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)不…… 不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)我可从来没有 小看过你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我熟知龙的一切{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.45,0:15:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我逼到这种地步的战术是最棒的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因如此，我才表示敬意，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡盖伏了下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)接招吧，我们的一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)干得漂亮，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)真是场有趣的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)你这家伙……为什么要试探我？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)在回答那个问题之前，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先讲讲这片土地流传的传说吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)米扎艾尔的传说吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从遥远的远古时代起，这片土地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}便由1只龙守护着。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尤其是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.73,0:16:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这片土地的勇者米扎艾尔与龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是心灵真正相通的好搭档，而且{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是在决斗中并肩作战的伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在龙与米扎埃尔的活跃下，安稳而
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和平的日子持续着。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而，某一年这片土地发生了严重的灾害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}许多无辜的人失去了性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那时一个流浪的祈祷师到访{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙给这片土地带来了灾祸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如此四处散布。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人们被那番话所蛊惑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对身为守护神的龙心生厌恶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定将其讨伐。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎埃尔拼命地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}试图说服人们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那番话没能传达到。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不仅如此，如果米扎埃尔是真正的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就应该打倒龙的声音{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接连不断地响起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于，米扎埃尔下定了决心。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他在龙的面前他向众人这样宣告。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为自己也会献出生命的代价，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望大家相信我的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.89,0:17:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那时。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}数百、数千支箭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贯穿了米扎艾尔和龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是来自邻国的军队，等待的就是这一刻{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻入了这片土地。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，那个祈祷师是那个国家派来的奸细。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样，这片土地毁灭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特，你身上无论陷入怎样的绝境{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.85,0:18:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都绝不会放弃自己命运的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和放弃了自己生命的米扎艾尔不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)闭嘴！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆)哦、哦，你是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神乐)米、米扎艾尔 你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 这不可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.06,0:18:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 你的灵魂中能感受到米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)别开玩笑了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.69,0:19:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)说我曾经是低等的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人类什么的 简直胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)你、你这家伙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)等等。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的对手 难道不是我吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于到了做个了断的时候了 海马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)海马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(方舟７)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔呃—— 我可不想被废弃掉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)今天就先撤退。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但下次一定会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.15,0:19:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)米扎艾尔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哇…… 这什么情况！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…… 这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.04,0:20:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)而且连那个叫金隆的家伙也不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)老爸的硬币……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆)传说还有后续。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙的灵魂接触到 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.77,0:20:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次苏醒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后直到今天一直守护着它。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特啊。你说过我在试探你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 正是如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当寻求遗迹中 No.卡之人出现之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界将会 发生巨变。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}年轻的驭龙者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将世界引导向正确的道路吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)正确的道路……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆)我啊，看见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在遥远的彼方天空中战斗着的，神圣的光与光。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那场战斗持续了数百日之久。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地上降下火雨，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}雷电撕裂了大地。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终，两道光芒相互碰撞，一同消灭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《阿斯特拉尔：这是我的记忆？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我曾经和巴利安战斗过吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.03,0:21:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆)凯特啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把这 No.托付给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢的战斗会将世界引向毁灭。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝不可重蹈覆辙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)没错，是这样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于想起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.67,0:22:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的使命是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.65,0:22:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭巴里安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.35,0:23:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.44,0:23:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.95,0:23:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.98,0:23:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.35,0:23:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.45,0:23:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.45,0:24:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
